## Lights on

::sfx{sound="power-up"}
@narrator: Down the coast, every streetlamp in Portvolt comes on at once and, for the first time in ten years, stays on.
@profAlder{vo}: {{userName}}? The Dex just did something it has never done. Thunderwing! I have one photograph of it, and it is mostly a smudge. Come to the lab when you can. Bring it. Please.
